{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's in the Demo?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the <strong>first Phase</strong> of the Cyber Rats experiment (5 mazes of increasing difficulty).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 biomes</strong>: Generic Sci-Fi, Forest, and Backrooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Cyborg Hunters</strong> to outsmart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 unlockable rats</strong> with different looks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approx. <strong>30\u201360 minutes of gameplay</strong>.<br><br>\u26a0\ufe0f Progress does not carry over in the demo (unlocks reset when you quit). In the full game, all progress is saved.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cyber Rats is a brutal rogue-lite survival horror game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a lab rat trapped in a sinister, AI-controlled test facility. Deadly mazes, cyborg monstrosities, and twisted experiments await. Can you survive the experiment\u2026 or will you become another failed test subject?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Death is part of the experiment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728970/extras/Steam_Gif_8.gif?t=1757750838\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 You are a lab rat trapped in a nightmarish AI-controlled facility, where every corner hides a gruesome death.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedurally generated death maze</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728970/extras/Steam_Gif_10.gif?t=1757750838\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      \u2022 A constantly shifting labyrinth. Procedural generation ensures\u00a0no maze is ever the same, and you never know, what will be hiding in the shadows.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nowhere to hide</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728970/extras/Steam_Gif_3.gif?t=1757750838\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 Find the cheese. Avoid the traps. Outsmart the Cyborg Hunters. Survive the maze\u2026 or become another failed experiment.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade your rats, and unlock new colours and rat types</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728970/extras/Steam_Gif_9.gif?t=1757750838\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 Unlock twisted new rats, zombie rats, cyborgs rats, mutants, and more!    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Upgrade, evolve, survive. Give your rats the edge they need to escape the AI\u2019s deadly experiments!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you find the way out of this sinister place?</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728970/extras/Steam_Gif_5.gif?t=1757750838\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Every rat matters. Every death counts. Survive the horrors, and break free from the AI\u2019s twisted experiment!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3728970?t=1757750838","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728970/d30c98ba3d08aa74cd050837e62539dc0ff49682/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757750838","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728970/ca72ebd5dcb06e7d015f75ed403d1301d16e2284/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757750838","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.aka